---
---

<section class="checkin-pulse" id="checkin" aria-labelledby="checkin-title">
  <div class="checkin-header">
    <div>
      <p class="board-eyebrow">Friend check-in</p>
      <h2 id="checkin-title">Today’s pulse</h2>
      <p class="checkin-lede">
        Open this before or after the group chat. Movers show what’s hot;
        setups flag where the radar score leans buy — for discussion, not advice.
      </p>
    </div>
    <nav class="checkin-jump" aria-label="Jump to sections">
      <a href="#checkin">Pulse</a>
      <a href="#watchlist-board">Master list</a>
      <a href="#submissions">Suggest</a>
    </nav>
  </div>

  <p class="checkin-method">
    <strong>How signals work:</strong> RSI · 52-week range · trend · SMA stretch —
    scored into Lean buy / Watch / Lean sell. Same playbook for every ticker on the master list.
  </p>

  <div class="checkin-grid">
    <article class="checkin-panel" aria-labelledby="movers-title">
      <header class="checkin-panel__head">
        <h3 id="movers-title">Top movers</h3>
        <p>Biggest % moves on our list</p>
      </header>
      <ol class="checkin-rank" id="checkin-movers" aria-live="polite">
        <li class="checkin-rank__empty">Loading quotes…</li>
      </ol>
    </article>

    <article class="checkin-panel checkin-panel--buy" aria-labelledby="setups-title">
      <header class="checkin-panel__head">
        <h3 id="setups-title">Buy setups</h3>
        <p>Highest radar score (lean buy first)</p>
      </header>
      <ol class="checkin-rank" id="checkin-setups" aria-live="polite">
        <li class="checkin-rank__empty">Scoring master list…</li>
      </ol>
    </article>

    <article class="checkin-panel" aria-labelledby="watch-title">
      <header class="checkin-panel__head">
        <h3 id="watch-title">Caution / trim leans</h3>
        <p>Extended or lean-sell names</p>
      </header>
      <ol class="checkin-rank" id="checkin-caution" aria-live="polite">
        <li class="checkin-rank__empty">Scoring master list…</li>
      </ol>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
